data: {"id": "b278e2665a5a430e-thinking-parallel_evidence-2476", "run_id": "b278e2665a5a430e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "基于已采集的 Kubernetes 事实与日志证据，对该 Pod 的异常状态及根因分析如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期确认\n*   **实体**：`aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8`\n*   **UID**：`08e11260-3505-495c-8224-2b91f27f029c`\n*   **状态**：`CrashLoopBackOff`。已重启 12 次，最近一次重启在 3m59s 前，当前处于等待重试的 back-off 阶段。\n\n### 2. 事实与证据\n*   **运行状态（支持）**：\n    *   `kubectl_get_yaml` 显示容器 `app` 状态为 `ready=False`，`exitCode=2`，且 `kubelet` 持续发出 `Back-off restarting failed container` 警告。这证实了 Pod 确实处于反复崩溃重启的状态。\n*   **崩溃日志（支持）**：\n    *   `kubectl_previous_logs`（上一次崩溃周期）与 `kubectl", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789067648564, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

